    "label": "Fatty replacement of skeletal muscle"
   },
   "description": "Fatty infiltration was detected in the following lower-limb muscles on MRI: the long and short head of the biceps femoris, semimembranosus, semitendinosus, adductor magnus and gracilis muscles in the thigh, and the tibialis anterior, extensor digitorum longus, peroneus longus muscles in the distal leg"
